  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With Youth &#x2013; Enhanced Protection, Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration and Health Assistance for Children and Young Migrants in Situations of Vulnerability in Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to assist children and young migrants with health assistance and assisted voluntary return and reintegration. It thus aims to improve access to necessary health care and awareness-raising activities on health risks and communicable diseases. The project also consists of the provision of services to support safe return for these migrants through active screening, Best Interest Assessment/Best Interest Determination for children, coordination with embassies, and pre-departure assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
